---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
import Link from "@components/Link.astro";
---

<Layout title="About" description="jhojin7의 소개와 연락처">
  <Container>
    <article class="animate space-y-8">
      <h1 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">About</h1>
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2>안녕하세요, jhojin7입니다.</h2>
        <p>이곳은 프로젝트와 생각을 기록하는 개인 공간입니다.</p>
        <p>
          만들고 있는 것들은 <Link href="/projects">Projects</Link>에, 글은 <Link
            href="/blog">Blog</Link
          >에 모아 둡니다.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2>Links</h2>
        <p>
          <Link href="https://github.com/jhojin7" external
            >GitHub · jhojin7</Link>
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </Container>
</Layout>
